IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User liyingli2018@gmail.com
PassCmd "pass mu4e/gmail"
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
# TLSVersions TLSv1.2
AuthMechs PLAIN
SystemCertificates no
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.maildir/gmail/
Inbox ~/.maildir/gmail/INBOX

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns *
Create Near
Sync All
Expunge Both
SyncState *

